&lt;p&gt;I wrote these notes while helping a bilingual storefront team choose &lt;strong&gt;live chat&lt;/strong&gt;, a &lt;strong&gt;bot&lt;/strong&gt;, and something agents could actually work from. The four products below are &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; interchangeable: one is a phone system with chat bolted on, one is marketing automation, one is managed bot-to-human handoff, and one is an open-source helpdesk you can host yourself. &lt;strong&gt;Pricing and channels change often&lt;/strong&gt;—use this as a map, then confirm on each vendor’s site.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>